  "notes": "{認|みと}める has two main uses: to recognize/acknowledge something, or to admit/confess.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{才能|さいのう}→才能：02772_sainou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{認|みと}める: to recognize talent\n- ⟦{間違|まちが}い→間違い：03733_machigai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{認|みと}める: to admit a mistake\n- ⟦{正式|せいしき}→正式：03376_seishiki⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{認|みと}める: to officially recognize\n- 〜と{認|みと}める: to acknowledge that ~\n\nPASSIVE FORM:\n{認|みと}められる: to be recognized/acknowledged\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{認|みと}め{印|いん}→認め印：07489_mitomein⟧: personal seal, approval stamp\n- ⟦{承認|しょうにん}→承認：03237_shounin⟧: approval, authorization",
